# @airing-cal/web-worker — local secrets (never commit real values)
# Production: `pnpm exec wrangler secret put THUMB_GEN_BEARER --name airing-cal-frontend`
# Must match QingLong / node-jobs `AIRINGCAL_THUMB_GEN_BEARER` and AiringCal homelab panel.

THUMB_GEN_BEARER=

# Documented cover thumb format (R2 key suffix `thumb.v1.webp`; transform fixed in thumb-gen.ts).
# Not a runtime Worker var today — bump only when shipping a new thumb key / transform revision.
THUMB_SPEC_REVISION=v1
